    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63646174768519,
          229.40605671296294,
          355.8489083333333,
          17.22571026234573
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            255,
            255,
            255,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/FAEFJO+AGaramond-Bold",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "To the Board of Directors and Stockholders of MGM MIRAGE"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63646174768519,
          274.8350690586419,
          804.6750185763888,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have audited the accompanying consolidated balance sheets of MGM MIRAGE (a Delaware corporation) and subsidiaries (the “Company”) as of December 31, 2004 and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63646174768519,
          296.97998842592597,
          777.4971791666667,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "2003, and the related consolidated statements of income, stockholders’ equity, and cash flows for each of the three years in the period ended December 31, 2004. These "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.6364261574074,
          319.1249077932099,
          744.1008403356481,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "financial statements are the responsibility of the Company’s management. Our responsibility is to express an opinion on the financial statements based on our audits."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.6365708912037,
          363.41503124999997,
          788.2614088541666,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We conducted our audits in accordance with the standards of the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (United States). Those standards require that we plan and "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63653411458334,
          385.55993479938263,
          773.7872474247685,
          15.659769675925986
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "perform the audit to obtain reasonable assurance about whether the financial statements are free of material misstatement. An audit includes examining, on a test basis, "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63653411458334,
          407.70485416666656,
          790.6118275752315,
          15.659769675925986
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "evidence supporting the amounts and disclosures in the financial statements. An audit also includes assessing the accounting principles used and significant estimates made "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63653411458334,
          429.8497735339506,
          697.8256956307871,
          15.659769675925872
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "by management, as well as evaluating the overall financial statement presentation. We believe that our audits provide a reasonable basis for our opinion."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63653411458334,
          474.1398969907407,
          793.7612349826388,
          15.659769675925986
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In our opinion, such consolidated financial statements present fairly, in all material respects, the financial position of the Company as of December 31, 2004 and 2003, and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63649852430555,
          496.2848163580246,
          800.9434123553241,
          15.659753858024828
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the results of its operations and its cash flows for each of the three years in the period ended December 31, 2004, in conformity with accounting principles generally accepted"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63649852430555,
          518.4297357253085,
          148.32164152199073,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "in the United States of America."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63649852430555,
          562.7198591820987,
          779.2702856192129,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have also audited, in accordance with the standards of the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (United States), the effectiveness of the Company’s internal "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63649852430555,
          584.8647785493827,
          807.5957335358796,
          15.659753858024771
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "control over financial reporting as of December 31, 2004, based on the criteria established in Internal Control—Integrated Framework issued by the Committee of Sponsoring"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63649852430555,
          607.0096979166666,
          789.8217352719907,
          15.659722222222285
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Organizations of the Treadway Commission and our report dated March 10, 2005 expressed an unqualified opinion on management’s assessment of the effectiveness of the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          86.63653411458334,
          629.1546014660494,
          731.4710833622685,
          15.659722222222229
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Company’s internal control over financial reporting and an unqualified opinion on the effectiveness of the Company’s internal control over financial reporting."
      }
    ],
